# Claude-BugHunter (Cursor Rule)

Use the **claude-bughunter** skill (`skills/claude-bughunter/SKILL.md`, `.agents/skills/claude-bughunter/SKILL.md`) when the user wants bug hunting and external red-team techniques for auditing targets within valid bug bounty program scope or systems they own/are authorized to test.

